                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The ending is absolutely awful. One of the worst, most vibe killing, most boneheaded, most pretentious fucking endings I've ever seen. Rest of the game is cool as shit though, if a bit undercooked. Episodes 1 and 4 in particular have really rough, very limited text based sections that are just a pain to play. 2 and 3 can be a little obtuse at times and even a little tedious, but are overall a joy to play. I give it Like a 7/10. Would be higher, but fuck the ending. Its so bad I almost didn't believe it at first.",
